  <item>
    <title>25. 恐惧是一个需要反复练习才能放下的东西：一个胆小者在海底的脱敏试验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69241af7cbba038b420bb975</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69241af7cbba038b420bb975</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Nov 2025 11:03:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🤿本期内容是没有运动天分又天生胆小的狄狄，人生首次在巴厘岛学潜水的全过程回溯——以及潜水这项运动，究竟可以给人们带来哪些「心理体验」。适合喜欢海和享受恐惧的你。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgBDrJnNVq2CZW2My2ECfq5qpuVu.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>两位普通的嘉宾：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>佳黛 《普通人的微光》主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>狄狄《普通朋友🌎》主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕐 </span><strong><span>节目时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:00:07</a></span></strong><span> 🌊</span><br><span>胆小主播回归！去巴厘岛考潜水证，直面深海与心底的恐惧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">00:08:12</a></span></strong><span> 😱</span><br><span>被亲妈和朋友鼓励式劝退，人没出发，恐惧先到。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">00:11:40</a></span></strong><span> ♋️</span><br><span>靠玄学壮胆：占星朋友说“你水元素丰沛，不会给海鲜丢脸”。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">00:17:50</a></span></strong><span> 🏊‍♀️</span><br><span>泳池第一课就崩溃，紧张到抽筋，还被教练一掌摁回水里。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">00:27:35</a></span></strong><span> 💡</span><br><span>怕水可能与“出生创伤”有关？聊聊窒息感如何影响现在。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2080">00:34:40</a></span></strong><span> 🏝️</span><br><span>第一次下海，脑中上演自杀电影，却因学会水下咳嗽而感动。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2586">00:43:06</a></span></strong><span> 🌀</span><br><span>在海底失去上下左右，一度吓出“心梗感”，靠看泡泡找回方向。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3095">00:51:35</a></span></strong><span> 🦈</span><br><span>潜伴退出，我却第一次看见鲨鱼，终于找到潜水的乐趣。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3395">00:56:35</a></span></strong><span> 🧘</span><br><span>教练水下打坐，我像滚筒洗衣机？聊聊“悬停”带来的恐惧。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4107">01:08:27</a></span></strong><span> 🌑</span><br><span>夜探沉船，一片漆黑却安全感满分，像回到母体。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4319">01:11:59</a></span></strong><span> 🪨</span><br><span>面对海底悬崖直接吓懵，为脱敏，花钱再去“跳崖”。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4449">01:14:09</a></span></strong><span> 🤿</span><br><span>潜水是理想人际关系：彼此支持，又各自独立。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4609">01:16:49</a></span></strong><span> 🎬</span><br><span>强推一部听障潜水题材电影，水下手语交流真诚又宁静。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5116">01:25:16</a></span></strong><span> 💎</span><br><span>恐惧不会在想象中消失，但会在真实体验中融化。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrELbrb5tVYtrjHs3HhAfd3f4vXN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>✍️狄狄在京郊差点溺水的文章：</span></strong></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/z7x9_AusKOcXqu1itjzOkA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/z7x9_AusKOcXqu1itjzOkA"><span>恐惧来自不确定感，所以呢？</span></a></h1><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵本期的音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>open this wall</span></p><span></span><p><span>手語課</span></p><span></span><p><span>I wish</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎬推荐的电影：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FunYOaNc3cKX1n6S-My_c2nLCU3k.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/632446a3d58ea913327a3097/lgSF86r90Nn4XRLKLi5GF2f9qRu4.m4a" length="85777405" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:28:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkPsOwU2wBus5FAS9zNii8LxHHke.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>25</itunes:episode>
