  </item>
  <item>
    <title>22. 人生究竟由自由意志支配or宿命控制？身心灵从业者大理山间杂谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d4829a3af97665af14bab0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d4829a3af97665af14bab0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Feb 2024 10:44:42 +0000</pubDate>
