    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽哈喽大家好，本期动物疗愈主题将会深度答疑《普通朋友vol.2》那期的听众留言提问，以及进阶分享作为疗愈人士如何疗愈自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别之处在于本期节目有视频版，将于一周内在视频平台陆续上线。b站/视频号/YouTube：狄与花</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐱🐶🪳🐦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj7c4EZID8FhwbiacMVAQbli2rIp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>本期嘉宾：</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>孔孔-动物沟通师、疗愈师 （公众号：宇宙和平ing）</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>本期主持：</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>狄狄-心理疗愈师 （公众号：狄狄家疗愈）</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>本期内容概览：</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 一些废话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 孔孔纠正狄狄对动物沟通师理解的定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a>朋友头发里长虱子的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">06:25</a>成功的动物沟通案例是怎样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a> 动物会鄙视我们吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a>好的动物沟通的标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a>宠物自己与动物家长之间认知落差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a>动物沟通每个人都可以学吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a>动物沟通是否存在灵性安全？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a>动物的问题，往往是动物家长问题的投射</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a>当人类孩子对毛孩子过敏</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuzdkDVZuw38eZaxaWAyxOvJsot5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a> 动物疗愈师日常如何疗愈自己？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2895">48:15</a> 孔孔的恐惧课题——关于失去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a>超越依赖，让自己的拼图变完整</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a>动物也有分离恐惧：狗会比猫怕死吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3490">58:10</a>自我疗愈的经验，如何用于帮助病痛与往生动物沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">65:00</a>面临人生低谷、至暗时刻，孔孔照料自己的绝招分享</span></p>]]></description>
